# The pin for the background pass's production vertex program.
# Written by sl_bggpu_depth_probe_pin.py --write-pin. The probe
# REFUSES to build when the extracted GLSL or the uniform list no
# longer hashes to these values, so a shader edit cannot reach a
# driver run under an earlier measurement's name. source_sha256 is
# provenance only: an unrelated edit to that file does not
# invalidate a depth measurement, a shader-text edit does.
